            "zh": "真正改产品的是「选择加入」：家长能自己决定孩子的行为数据是否进入那些长期画像，默认设置必须改掉，还要给退出的人留一条损失不大的路径。代价真实但不致命——少了一些续约。",
            "en": "What actually changes the product is the opt-in: parents decide whether a child's behavioural data enters the long-term profiles, the default has to change, and those who opt out need a path that costs them little. The cost is real but survivable — you lose some renewals."
